[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Introducing Monospace, a new managed API layer from the Directus team. AI has changed the speed of your teams, but the data they need is in your operational systems —the databases and'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'business tools that reflect the current situation. But every new development starts the same way . Waiting for access, creating another API, re-engineering the rules that already exist. Weeks of work'

[00:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'before the actual creation begins. Your developers don\'t have to wait for access. Your organization should not lose control. Monospace solves both'

[00:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'problems. Monospace is a managed API layer for the databases, systems, and interfaces you already use. Connect the data source and it\'s ready to go.'

[00:48] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Monospace automatically generates a REST API and fully typed SDK for developers, an admin panel for business users, and an MCP server for agents. Each'

[01:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'application, user, and agent has its own identity. Access is managed by a single permissions model with rules at the workspace, row, and field levels. Every action is recorded:'

[01:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'which entry, which subject, and when. Nothing is moving. No repositories, ETL, or copies. Your data stays where it is. Real-time read and write operations'

[01:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'flow through Monospace to your source system. This is built for real operational work and fast agents. Self-hosted, secure by design,'

[01:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'SOC 2 certified. Built by the Directus team, trusted by hundreds of enterprises to support their business applications. Monospace—a single API layer for your entire'

[01:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'enterprise: for the developers building products, the teams using them, and the agents operating them. Try it on your own data at Monospace.io.'
